# _rl_krisen.inc - Crises and their resolutions (Umsetzung 15, Phase 4 sections 4.2 and 4.3).
# Shared by every madam, told in a narrator's voice. Plain ASCII only.

# What happened (1100 + event type)
{1109}{}{(One of the girls is dead. The others have closed her door and don't go near it. Everybody is waiting to see what you do.)}
{1110}{}{(A regular in the private rooms talks too much when he drinks. Tonight he talked about money that isn't his and people who aren't alive anymore.)}
{1112}{}{(Kitty made one of ours an offer: better money, a room of her own. She hasn't said yes. She hasn't said no.)}
{1113}{}{(The runners were robbed on the road. $}
{1119}{}{ gone. One of them saw which way the robbers went.)}
{1114}{}{(A guest threw a bottle at Vesper in the middle of a song. "Dead skin doesn't sing," he says. Half the room agrees with him.)}
{1115}{}{(Abigail stands in the doorway of a private room. The man in the bed voted to take her citizenship away. He doesn't recognize her. She is holding a syringe.)}
{1116}{}{(Two men in steel armor with the Brotherhood's gear symbol stand at the door. They are asking about a deserter. They know his name.)}

# The announced raid (1120 + house)
{1120}{}{(Word came through Tyler's boys: tomorrow night the guild's men will search the Gutter. They are looking for runaways.)}
{1121}{}{(A family is sending men to the Garter next week. Not to drink. To find out how weak we are.)}
{1122}{}{(Sheriff Marion will search the Slag next week. He'll look at the scales, and he'll ask the stall owners who they pay.)}
{1123}{}{(The Garde is coming. They always come in the end.)}
{1124}{}{(The police will come to the Trough next week. They'll check papers, and if the Rangers ride with them, they'll check who's behind which door.)}
{1125}{}{Move the runaways out for a night.}
{1126}{}{Hire extra guns for the night. ($200)}
{1127}{}{I'll wait for them myself.}
{1128}{}{Swap in an honest scale before Marion comes.}
{1129}{}{Call off the protection racket.}
{1138}{}{[Sneak] Hide Vortis' people.}

# Soldiers without a war
{1130}{}{Pay them $200 to drink somewhere else.}
{1131}{}{[Barter] Drink them under the table.}
{1132}{}{(It takes all night and most of the good bottles. Near dawn the soldiers are asleep on the floor, still in their armor.)}
{1133}{}{Take one suit of armor while they sleep.}
{1134}{}{Let them sleep it off and go.}
{1135}{}{[Speech] Ask them about their unit.}
{1136}{}{[Speech] Offer one of them a job.}
{1137}{}{Throw them out. By force.}

# The stuff
{1140}{}{Our infirmary will take care of her.}
{1141}{}{Send her to the detox room at the Slag.}
{1142}{}{Myron's antidote. Give her a dose.}

# Violent john, plague, till, runaways
{1150}{}{[Unarmed] I'll deal with him myself.}
{1151}{}{Ban him from the house.}
{1152}{}{[Doctor] I'll treat them myself.}
{1153}{}{Pay a doctor from town. ($300)}
{1154}{}{Close the house for two weeks.}
{1155}{}{[Intelligence] Go through the books.}
{1156}{}{[Sneak] Watch who goes near the till.}
{1157}{}{Let it go.}
{1158}{}{Let them go.}
{1159}{}{Bring them back.}

# Death, secret, poaching, robbery, ghoul, judge, bunker
{1160}{}{Bury her properly. ($100)}
{1161}{}{Keep it quiet.}
{1162}{}{Find whoever did this.}
{1163}{}{Put what he said in the file.}
{1164}{}{Sell him his silence. ($200)}
{1165}{}{Forget what he said.}
{1166}{}{[Barter] Make her a better offer. ($100)}
{1167}{}{Let her go to Kitty.}
{1168}{}{[Outdoorsman] Follow the robbers' trail.}
{1169}{}{Write it off.}
{1170}{}{Throw him out before anyone joins in.}
{1171}{}{[Speech] Talk the room down.}
{1172}{}{Let the bouncer handle it, eventually.}
{1173}{}{Let Abigail heal him.}
{1174}{}{Let Abigail expose him.}
{1175}{}{Let Abigail use the syringe.}
{1176}{}{Hand the deserter over.}
{1177}{}{[Sneak] Hide him in the cellar.}
{1178}{}{Tell the Brotherhood to leave.}

# Outcomes
{1180}{}{(They take the money and leave. One of them looks back at the door as if he's memorizing it.)}
{1181}{}{(The armor is heavy, and it smells of sweat and old blood. By noon the soldiers are gone, and one of them walks barefoot.)}
{1182}{}{(At noon they stagger out into the light. Nobody is hurt. Nobody is paid, either.)}
{1183}{}{(You ask about his unit. He answers with numbers, then with names, then not at all. They leave without a word.)}
{1184}{}{(One of them stays. He sleeps in the storeroom and stands at the door at night. Nobody tries anything while he's there. Somewhere, the Brotherhood keeps a list of deserters.)}
{1185}{}{(It's short and loud. Afterwards there are three suits of armor to strip and sell, and three bodies nobody wants to explain.)}
{1186}{}{(Two weeks of shaking and sweating, then she is back at work. The others watched how it was handled.)}
{1187}{}{(By the time they come, there will be nothing to find.)}
{1188}{}{(Five hired guns sit in the hall all night with their weapons on the tables. Whoever comes will count them.)}
{1189}{}{(You will be waiting in the dark when they come. Whatever happens, the whole street will hear about it.)}
{1190}{}{(The rigged scale goes into the river. Marion will find honest weights and honest prices, and the take will be smaller.)}
{1191}{}{(The stall owners keep their money this week. Marion will find nobody who is afraid of you. Not openly.)}
{1192}{}{(He leaves on his own feet, barely. He won't come back, and neither will his friends.)}
{1193}{}{(His name goes on the list by the door. A few regulars think the house has gone soft.)}
{1194}{}{(Boiled water, clean sheets, long nights. Nobody dies.)}
{1195}{}{(The doctor takes the money and doesn't ask what kind of house this is. He's seen worse.)}
{1196}{}{(The doors stay shut for two weeks. The sick get better. The customers go elsewhere, for now.)}
{1197}{}{(The numbers don't add up, and then they do. Most of the money turns up in a boot under a bed.)}
{1198}{}{(Two nights of watching. The one who took it is gone by morning, and most of the money stays.)}
{1199}{}{(The money is gone. So is some of the respect.)}
{1200}{}{(Their rooms are empty. Somebody else will fill them.)}
{1201}{}{(You find them on the road, cold and hungry. They come back. Not because they want to.)}
{1202}{}{(A grave with a name on it, and everyone from the house standing around it. Afterwards they work a little harder, for her.)}
{1203}{}{(A body goes out the back door at night. Nobody talks about it. Everybody thinks about it.)}
{1204}{}{(It takes three days to find him. After that the whole street knows what happens to people who hurt ours.)}
{1205}{}{(Every word goes into the file. One day it will be worth something.)}
{1206}{}{(He pays without looking at you. He'll never come back, and he'll never forget your face.)}
{1207}{}{(A house that forgets what it hears. Some people pay extra for that.)}
{1208}{}{(She stays. Kitty sends a note: "Next time." Kitty always sends a note.)}
{1209}{}{(She leaves with one bag. At the door she says she's sorry. She doesn't look it.)}
{1210}{}{(Two days on their trail. The robbers didn't expect anyone to follow. The money comes back to New Reno, most of it.)}
{1211}{}{(The road took its share. The road always does.)}
{1212}{}{(He's in the street before he finishes his sentence. Vesper starts the song again from the beginning.)}
{1213}{}{(You talk until the room is quiet. Then Vesper sings, and nobody leaves early.)}
{1214}{}{(The bouncer takes his time. Vesper finishes the evening with a cut over her eye and doesn't sing an encore.)}
{1215}{}{(Abigail treats him properly. He thanks her and never knows whom he thanked. She sits in the kitchen afterwards for a long time.)}
{1216}{}{(Three days later the whole of Vault City knows where the councilman spends his nights. Abigail doesn't smile. But she sleeps.)}
{1217}{}{(The councilman dies in his sleep, of his heart, the doctors say. Abigail washes her hands for a long time.)}
{1218}{}{(They take him away in irons. He doesn't fight. The door is emptier at night now.)}
{1219}{}{(The Brotherhood searches the house and finds nothing. They'll be back.)}
{1220}{}{(The Brotherhood leaves. Not because you asked. Because they're counting what a fight here would cost them.)}
